[06:52] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'solid layers of very thick white plastic. This was my first mistake. So, it\'s entirely my fault. Usually you need to mask off'

[07:05] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'areas you don\'t want to print on. Forgot about this step. And the problem is that I also applied my own heightmap, which made the white area, the void, the highest. Therefore, printing took about 4 hours. I thought, "This is'

[07:18] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'way too long." And then I looked at it, and everything became clear. I am an idiot . I usually have a rule: check before you act, but I didn\'t do that. And sometimes that\'s how disasters happen.'

[07:30] [scene:talk]
