VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'preparing these files for Kickstarter and mass production, I try to make them that way . But in reality, when you produce something locally or independently on a smaller scale, you certainly don\'t use the'

[09:06] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'same methods. So I\'m learning so you don\'t have to make the same mistakes when UV printing. It turns out that UV printing should be done as intended for printing, not as intended for mass production . That\'s what I learned. I also learned that'

