[12:40] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'reverse, that is, print the color directly on the surface and then print with white ink. And by doing this, by printing the inverted image first and then the white backing on clear acrylic, you get this'

[12:53] [scene:talk]
