[17:13] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'of course I printed a big roll of my card shirts onto canvas. The canvas is quite soft since it is usually intended to be hung on walls or be a piece of art,'

[17:25] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'not necessarily for playing cards, but that is easy to fix. So I laser cut some acrylic templates to clamp my layouts into, and using laser cut squares'

[17:37] [scene:talk]
